# Paths that need the owner's review before a PR merges into dev. The dev ruleset's
# "Require review from Code Owners" enforces this; every other path merges on green CI.
# A path is owned when merging it unread could change the gate, change what sessions
# load or run, or ship code that runs on users' machines. Each line says which.

# The gate: CI that "green" depends on, and this file.
/.github/ @bogheorghiu

# What sessions working in this repo load and obey.
/.claude/ @bogheorghiu
/CLAUDE.md @bogheorghiu

# Run at every session start by the hook in .claude/settings.json.
/tools/board/ @bogheorghiu

# Keeps local caches and keys out of `git add -A`.
/.gitignore @bogheorghiu

# Hook code and manifests that run or load on every user's machine once released.
# Listed per plugin: a new plugin needs its own lines here.
/.claude-plugin/ @bogheorghiu
/plugins/shared-rules/hooks/ @bogheorghiu
/plugins/shared-rules/.claude-plugin/ @bogheorghiu
/plugins/shared-rules-custom-repo/hooks/ @bogheorghiu
/plugins/shared-rules-custom-repo/.claude-plugin/ @bogheorghiu
